 'image-converter':['Convert a browser-readable image to JPEG, PNG or WebP without uploading it. Choose a transparent format for logos or a compact photographic format for sharing.','Turn a large PNG photo into a JPEG at 90% quality, or keep a transparent logo as PNG.','JPEG does not preserve transparency. GIF and other animated inputs are exported as a single frame.'],
