 discount:['Calculate the final price after a discount and an optional tax added to the discounted amount. See the savings and tax separately.','Apply a 15% discount to NPR 2500, then add 13% tax to the reduced price.','This tool applies discount first and tax second. A retailer may include tax in its displayed prices or use different rounding.'],
