 compound:['Explore how an initial balance and regular month-end contributions can grow at a constant annual rate. Choose a compounding frequency.','Start with NPR 100000 and add NPR 5000 each month to explore a ten-year savings scenario.','This is a mathematical projection, not a promised return. Taxes, fees and inflation are not included.'],
