 'date-difference':['Count elapsed days between two calendar dates, with an option to include both endpoints. Get a useful weeks-and-days breakdown.','Count how many days remain in a 30-day study plan or include both travel dates in a trip.','Dates are calculated in UTC to avoid daylight-saving shifts. This counts calendar days, including weekends and holidays.'],
 'unit-converter':['Convert lengths, weights, areas, volumes, temperatures and data sizes. Nepal land units are included alongside metric and imperial units.','Convert 16 aana to approximately one ropani, or convert meters to feet for a room measurement.','Land-unit definitions can vary by region. KB and KiB use different decimal and binary bases and are listed separately.'],
