 'ielts-overall':['Calculate an overall IELTS band from Listening, Reading, Writing and Speaking scores using the official averaging and half-band rounding rule.','Scores of 6.5, 6.5, 5.0 and 7.0 average 6.25 and round to an overall band of 6.5.','Enter awarded component bands in half-band steps. An overall score does not replace a university’s individual skill requirements.'],
 'ielts-listening':['Estimate an IELTS Listening practice band from the number of correct answers out of 40. Use the result to follow practice progress.','A practice mark of 30 out of 40 corresponds to an indicative Listening band of 7.0.','Raw-score boundaries vary slightly between test versions. This is a practice estimate, not an official test result.'],
 'ielts-reading':['Estimate a Reading practice band for IELTS Academic or General Training. Choose the correct test type before entering your raw mark.','Compare 30 correct answers in Academic Reading with 30 in General Training to see why the scales differ.','Actual boundaries depend on the test version. General Training usually needs more correct answers for the same band.'],
 'word-counter':['Count words, Unicode characters, paragraphs and UTF-8 bytes as you write. Estimate reading and speaking time from common pacing assumptions.','Check whether a draft is near a 250-word target or estimate how long a short script will take to read.','Words are counted by whitespace. Reading-time estimates use 200 words per minute and speaking estimates use 130.'],
 'case-converter':['Change text to uppercase, lowercase, title or sentence case. Convert phrases into camelCase, snake_case or kebab-case for coding and labels.','Turn a page title into a lowercase, hyphenated slug, or normalize an all-uppercase draft.','Automatic title and sentence case cannot infer proper nouns. Review names, acronyms and language-specific capitalization.'],
