 'text-compare':['Compare two texts line by line and highlight additions and removals. Review changes without sending a document to a server.','Compare the original and edited versions of a short description to see which lines were replaced.','The comparison supports up to 400 lines per input and is line-based rather than a word-level document redline.'],
 'lorem-ipsum':['Generate readable placeholder paragraphs for a layout, mockup or presentation. Choose the number of paragraphs and sentences you need.','Create three four-sentence paragraphs to check spacing in a card or content section.','The output combines a classic lorem ipsum opening with original neutral English sentences. Replace it before publishing final content.'],
 'json-formatter':['Validate JSON and format it with two or four spaces, or minify it to a compact representation. Copy the clean result for development.','Format an API response to make nested objects and array entries easier to inspect.','The input must be valid JSON, with quoted property names and no comments or trailing commas. Keep a copy of large numeric identifiers.'],
 base64:['Encode UTF-8 text as Base64 and decode Base64 back into readable text. Unicode text, including Nepali, is supported.','Encode a short message containing non-ASCII characters, then decode it to verify the original text.','Base64 is not encryption. This tool handles text; it does not turn binary files into a downloadable file format.'],
 'url-encoder':['Encode or decode a URL component so spaces and special characters can travel safely within query parameters.','Encode a search term containing an ampersand without changing the structure of the surrounding URL.','Use this for individual components rather than encoding an entire destination URL indiscriminately. Invalid percent escapes cannot be decoded.'],
 password:['Generate a random password with selected character groups and length. Use cryptographically secure browser randomness without saving the result.','Create a 20-character password with letters, digits and symbols while excluding easily confused characters.','Choose a unique password per account and save it in a password manager. A generated password is not stored by this website.'],
