 'images-to-pdf':['Place one or more images into a PDF document in your chosen order. Use A4, US Letter or image-sized pages with adjustable margins.','Combine scans of several pages into one PDF while selecting portrait or landscape page orientation.','Images are flattened onto white and embedded as JPEG. Keep original image files if you need their original metadata or transparency.'],
