 'pdf-extract':['Extract selected pages from a PDF and arrange them in the order you enter. Use comma-separated pages and inclusive ranges.','Enter 3, 1-2 to export page three first, followed by pages one and two.','Page numbers start at one. Keep all ranges within the source document and use an unencrypted copy of the PDF.'],
 'qr-code':['Create a static QR code from text or a URL and export a scalable SVG or high-resolution PNG. No tracking or link-shortening service is used.','Make a QR code for a website address and download an SVG for a printed card.','Scan the exported code before printing. Leave its quiet-zone border visible and avoid stretching the code into a non-square shape.'],
 'random-picker':['Select one or more entries from a list using secure browser randomness. Duplicate entries are removed and picks are made without replacement.','Choose three unique participants from a class list or pick the next task from your backlog.','Each unique line is one entry. This is a simple local selection tool rather than an audited competition platform.'],
 pomodoro:['Start a focused work session with a visible countdown. Choose a custom duration or switch between focus, short break and long break presets.','Work on one task for 25 minutes, then reset the timer for a five-minute break.','Keep the tool open. Browsers can suspend background tabs, and a soft completion sound depends on browser audio support.'],
 stopwatch:['Measure elapsed time, pause and resume, and record lap totals with intervals. Timing uses the browser’s monotonic clock.','Time a practice task and capture a lap each time you finish one section.','The stopwatch resets when you leave the tool or reload the page. It is not intended for precision scientific timing.'],
 'image-to-text':['Extract editable English or Nepali text from a screenshot or photo using local optical character recognition. Copy the result or download a text file.','Turn a clear printed note or screenshot into text you can paste into an editor.','The recognition engine and language data download on first use. Handwriting, blur and mixed layouts can reduce accuracy.'],
 'meme-generator':['Add your own top and bottom captions to an image. Adjust caption size and export a finished meme without an added branding overlay.','Add a two-line joke to a photo and save a PNG for sharing with friends.','Use an image you have the right to share. Short captions fit better; the preview will flag text that overwhelms the image.'],
 'social-resizer':['Place a photo into a square, portrait, story, landscape or thumbnail canvas. Fill the frame with a crop or fit the entire image on a colored background.','Prepare the same photo as a 1080 × 1080 square and a 1080 × 1920 vertical canvas.','These are convenient canvas sizes, not a guarantee of every platform’s current requirements. Important content should stay away from interface overlays.'],
