 'image-filters':['Adjust brightness, contrast and saturation, then optionally apply black-and-white or sepia styling. Export your edited photo locally.','Increase a dim image’s brightness slightly and compare it with a desaturated version.','Filters change pixel appearance and do not restore missing detail. Extreme settings can clip highlights, shadows or color.'],
 'subtitle-converter':['Convert pasted SRT subtitles into WebVTT or convert WebVTT cues to SRT. Copy the timing and text or download a ready-to-use subtitle file.','Turn numbered SRT cues into a VTT file for an HTML video player.','The tool converts subtitle text, not speech. SRT output drops VTT positioning, style blocks and other format-specific presentation settings.'],
 'utm-builder':['Add consistent campaign parameters to a destination link. Preserve existing query values while setting source, medium, campaign and optional labels.','Create a link labeled instagram, social and creator-launch for a bio or promotional post.','UTM parameters are visible in the URL. The tool does not run analytics, shorten links or redirect visitors through another service.'],
 'qr-reader':['Decode a QR code from a selected image without opening the destination. Review the decoded text before deciding what to do next.','Read a QR code in a screenshot to see its complete destination address as text.','Use a sharp image containing the full square and quiet-zone border. Displaying a decoded link does not verify that its destination is safe.'],
 'emoji-picker':['Search a curated set of Unicode emoji by a descriptive keyword. Build a small sequence and copy it into a post, message or caption.','Search for Nepal, code, love or celebration and combine the matching emoji.','Emoji appearance and availability depend on your device. The tool provides standard characters rather than custom downloadable stickers.'],
 'gradient-generator':['Create a three-color linear or radial CSS gradient and preview the result. Adjust colors and angle, then copy the background declaration.','Combine sage, blue and peach into a soft background for a website section.','A radial gradient does not use the linear angle setting. Check foreground text contrast before applying your gradient to a live page.'],
