 'contrast-checker':['Calculate the contrast ratio between two opaque sRGB colors and compare it with WCAG AA and AAA text thresholds. Preview a real text sample.','Check dark green text on an off-white background before using the pair in a button or article.','Passing a contrast threshold is one part of accessible design. The tool does not audit layout, keyboard navigation or text over images.'],
 'markdown-to-html':['Convert Markdown into sanitized HTML with a visible preview. Copy the markup or download a small standalone HTML document.','Draft a heading, a bullet list and a link in Markdown, then export the formatted document.','Scripts, styles, embedded images and form controls are removed from the preview. Review any external links you include.'],
 'json-to-csv':['Convert a JSON array of objects into UTF-8 CSV using the combined set of property names as columns. Choose a delimiter and spreadsheet formula handling.','Export a list of people with name, role and country fields to a CSV spreadsheet.','Nested values remain JSON text. Formula-like strings can be neutralized with an apostrophe; select raw values only when you intend to preserve them.']
